        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 92,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "A brutish man knoweth not; neither doth a fool understand this.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 92:6",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 92,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "When the wicked spring as the grass, and when all the workers of iniquity do flourish; it is that they shall be destroyed for ever:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 87,
            "end": 92
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 92:7",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 92,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "But thou, Lord, art most high for evermore.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 24
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 92:8",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 92,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "For, lo, thine enemies, O Lord, for, lo, thine enemies shall perish; all the workers of iniquity shall be scattered.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 92:9",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 92,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "But my horn shalt thou exalt like the horn of an unicorn: I shall be anointed with fresh oil.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 46,
            "end": 56,
            "text": "HEB a buffalo, bison."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 34,
            "end": 45
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 92:10",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 92,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Mine eye also shall see my desire on mine enemies, and mine ears shall hear my desire of the wicked that rise up against me.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 33
          },
          {
            "start": 51,
            "end": 54
          },
          {
            "start": 76,
            "end": 85
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 92:11",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 92,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "The righteous shall flourish like the palm tree: he shall grow like a cedar in Lebanon.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 28,
            "text": "Ps. 52:8."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
